# Restored-src runtime configuration — copy this file to `telemetry.env` and
# fill it in. `telemetry.env` is gitignored; only this `.example` template is
# committed. bin/claude sources the file at process launch, so auth/endpoint
# detection already sees these values before the login screen appears.
#
#   cp telemetry.env.example telemetry.env
#
# Set exactly ONE auth source. If both ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# are set, the CLI aborts into an "auth conflict" screen rather than picking one.

# ── Option A: official Anthropic API / Claude subscription ──────────────────
# Use your personal API key (sk-ant-…), or omit both keys and sign in with
# `/login` instead.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# ── Option B: Anthropic-compatible gateway / proxy (Bearer token) ───────────
# For example DeepSeek's Anthropic endpoint: https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# ── Model routing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL overrides the default model. The DEFAULT_*_MODEL vars
# override what each plan tier (opus/sonnet/haiku) resolves to, so you can point
# the runtime at a single gateway alias regardless of the plan label used.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
# ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
# ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
# ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash

# ── Optional: feed the http-visualizer dev tool ─────────────────────────────
# Full ingest URL of the server started by `./lab/http-visualizer/run.sh`.
# Each LLM request is POSTed there (fire-and-forget) before it is sent to the
# gateway, grouped by querySource (main thread / SDK / agent / …).
# CLAUDE_CODE_HTTP_VISUALIZER_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:8788/ingest

# ── Optional: quiet, offline-ish study runs ─────────────────────────────────
# Disables non-essential outbound traffic (feature flags, telemetry, …).
# CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC=1
